                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "In this video game about going into a pitch black dungeon, you drop your only source of light on death until you successfully complete a corpse run without it in order to get it back.\n\nOh, and on your run back, watch out for the near-invisible instant kill spike traps in the [b]pitch black dungeon[/b] this game takes place in, which, you guessed it, will [b]instantly kill you.[/b]\n\nWhat a fun game. What fun design choices. I'm glad I played this.",
